    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Worgen</em></p><p>You have grown accustom to your worgen form, realizing the benefits that come with it. You gain the following benefits while in your worgen form:</p><ul><li><p>You have advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks that rely on smell.</p></li><li><p>While both your hands are empty, you can take the Dash action as a bonus action, running on all four.</p></li><li><p>Your claws grow large, and become natural weapons, which you can use to make unarmared strikes. If you hit with them, you deal slashing damage equal to 1d4 + your Strength modifier, instead of normal bludgeoning damage for an unarmed strike.</p></li><li><p>If you make a bite attack as an action, you can use your bonus action to make an attack with your claws.</p></li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
